<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose nine points to 1,334.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose nine points to 1,334.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,334 today from 1,325 on July 1, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.  Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1394    12.656	  1394    12.656</p>
<p>   1a   1325 10038.000	  1325 10038.000</p>
